{"title":"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lie on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" />. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/4373e7b4be983c0315e82e1fda1df66ed34dd7fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" />, and the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is what fraction of the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c101a83a36582f8a81743f5221726366cd7df87f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{36}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{13}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{10}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{36}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"404\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/81729cf4848260b6feda8ea5ae3f1d0867c890eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/091bc5870382d505d636ab83ea04695b7ba41afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 4(BC + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d3ace56f8908e0632b0fd074f3e22bfe6715ec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB + BC = 9\\cdot1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"134\" height=\"14\" />. From this system of equations, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/74666022a42f4446ed551033a088108882c5ec09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> to both sides of the second equation, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5c95cb4608797b8dd5e695dd4fbde058cfaa921.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = AB + BC + CD = 9 + 1 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"291\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885318956a062f514d59cddfa7043d1574721b28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{BC}{AD} = \\frac{1}{10} \\implies\\text{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"152\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09b53bc2fca4c7b9bfdc4992fc5b8c2c7c8f4d7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4fefe00fc71dd59b290161f8826a3ca9ab561a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa337822ed6e0d1fbe0353c97ac669bcb9b139d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac8352ca5ec19a7188b7bac61e0b6db58a1945a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = 9y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />, as shown in the diagram(the labels on the bottom are for that line segment while the labels on the top are from one point to the left to one point to the right).  \n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c823a0e65436eb1b8301afac4a021da61ea747.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] dot((0,0));  label(&quot;A&quot;, (0,0), S); dot((5,0));  label(&quot;B&quot;, (5,0), S); dot((10,0));  label(&quot;C&quot;, (10,0), S);  dot((15,0));  label(&quot;D&quot;, (15,0), S);  draw((0,0)--(5,0)); draw((5,0)--(10,0));  draw((10,0)--(15,0)); draw((0,0)--(10,0)); draw((10,0)--(15,0)); label(&quot;$4x$&quot;, (0,0)--(5,0), S); label(&quot;$9y$&quot;, (0,0)--(10,0), N); label(&quot;$y$&quot;, (10,0)--(15,0), S); label(&quot;$x$&quot;, (5,0)--(15,0), N);    [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"48\" /></center>\n<p>From this, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c84d94da57e9f33bbef71a891b60004a2e995e79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = 10y = 5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/7/f6731250bee70a0d690127ecfd5e5c01a8c7a8c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = BD - CD = x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"18\" />. Now, our ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4553b3f212c077d4312dcd7caf6fe85c19fabb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-y}{AD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"37\" />. We can split this into 2 fractions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5ca659cf9e3fdc89377c9419390272ddd08cd220.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{AD} - \\frac{y}{AD} = \\frac{x}{5x} - \\frac{y}{10y} = \\frac{1}{5} - \\frac{1}{10} =  \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"366\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B\">2008 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p